summary:
Two community projects joined the directories: a chat interface and a prompt generator with image previews.

@altkriz’s EvilChat was added to the Chat project directory, with links to its app and source code. It’s a responsive, dark-themed interface built with the Pollinations API.

Promptgenerator.art was added to the creative projects directory. It turns simple ideas into structured prompts for Midjourney, DALL·E, and ChatGPT, with a Pollinations-powered Test Visualization preview.
